# Documentation

1. Read `.agent/skills/minihub-docs/SKILL.md`.
2. Prefer `docs/en/` + `docs/zh_CN/` RST when those trees exist; keep the same relative `.rst` paths in both languages.
3. Prefer RST as the source of truth; do not dual-write Markdown chapters that duplicate `docs/en/`.
4. Build: `./tools/build_docs.sh` (uses `.venv-docs` when present). Warnings fail the build.
5. Do not document deleted Kconfig (e.g. `CONFIG_MINIHUB_NET_PREFER_ETH`) or removed products (`application/claw_minihub`).
6. Default route is `minihub_net_refresh_default_netif()` (Ethernet if it has IPv4, else Wi-Fi).
